{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 50-1. Parāmāsaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-44-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-44a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22496.624380864578\">6:14:56</span> 1. Noparāmāsaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noparāmāso kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22509.18207396948\">6:15:09</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22514.022168908446\">6:15:14</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22518.697647011442\">6:15:18</span> 3. Parāmāsaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noparāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22527.932584980925\">6:15:27</span> Noparāmāsaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noparāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22537.792567011445\">6:15:37</span> Parāmāsaṃ akusalañca noparāmāsaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca noparāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22553.996270988555\">6:15:53</span> 4. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22558.52804315068\">6:15:58</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca, napacchājāte pañca…pe… (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22571.943723034332\">6:16:11</span> 5. Noparāmāso akusalo dhammo noparāmāsassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22583.36348880545\">6:16:23</span> 6. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22589.504425123025\">6:16:29</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22602.583702008582\">6:16:42</span> 7. Noparāmāsaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noparāmāso abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22616.49908291131\">6:16:56</span> 8. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44a-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22621.392035040055\">6:17:01</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 51-1. Parāmaṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-44b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22626.930140871253\">6:17:06</span> 9. Parāmaṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44b-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22637.264872957083\">6:17:17</span> Aparāmaṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aparāmaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22644.736645845504\">6:17:24</span> 10. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44b-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22649.28610419455\">6:17:29</span> (Sahajātavāropi …pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22654.146467991417\">6:17:34</span> 11. Parāmaṭṭhaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44b-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22662.835773077248\">6:17:42</span> 12. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44b-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22669.511554\">6:17:49</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22673.734849154494\">6:17:53</span> 13. Parāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44b-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22683.306817048637\">6:18:03</span> Aparāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aparāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22693.298801346184\">6:18:13</span> Parāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca aparāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22730.83915809537\">6:18:50</span> 14. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… āsevane ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-44b-14</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 52-1. Parāmāsasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-44c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22743.156651212194\">6:19:03</span> 15. Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22753.074400990463\">6:19:13</span> 16. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22757.924188866487\">6:19:17</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22762.828441957085\">6:19:22</span> 17. Parāmāsasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44c-17</p><p><br /></p><p>Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22773.198025040056\">6:19:33</span> 18. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve (sabbattha dve)…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22778.921929762535\">6:19:38</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā dve (sabbattha dve)…pe… navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22792.431223962805\">6:19:52</span> 19. Parāmāsasampayutto akusalo dhammo parāmāsasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-44c-19</p><p><br /></p><p>Parāmāsavippayutto akusalo dhammo parāmāsavippayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22805.756723851227\">6:20:05</span> 20. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe cattāri, adhipatiyā cattāri (majjhime ca ante ca ārammaṇādhipati), anantare dve…pe… sahajāte dve…pe… upanissaye cattāri, āsevane dve, kamme dve, āhāre dve…pe… magge dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22828.22175888556\">6:20:28</span> 21. Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22838.729828957086\">6:20:38</span> 22. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44c-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22844.06337205722\">6:20:44</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 53-1. Parāmāsaparāmaṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-44d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22849.44130725463\">6:20:49</span> 23. Parāmaṭṭhañceva no ca parāmāsaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22864.10648278256\">6:21:04</span> 24. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22869.91497100572\">6:21:09</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22874.213812243186\">6:21:14</span> 25. Parāmāsañceva parāmaṭṭhañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… ekaṃ. ^7-44d-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22885.853712048636\">6:21:25</span> Parāmaṭṭhañceva no ca parāmāsaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22899.57528907725\">6:21:39</span> Parāmāsañceva parāmaṭṭhaṃ akusalañca parāmaṭṭhañceva no ca parāmāsaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22917.905221868394\">6:21:57</span> 26. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22923.077286954223\">6:22:03</span> (Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22927.87196813733\">6:22:07</span> 27. Parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso akusalo dhammo parāmaṭṭhassa ceva no ca parāmāsassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22939.48876786839\">6:22:19</span> 28. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22945.493916097275\">6:22:25</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22959.216310814034\">6:22:39</span> 29. Parāmaṭṭhañceva no ca parāmāsaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmaṭṭho ceva no ca parāmāso abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-44d-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22975.481845925613\">6:22:55</span> 30. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-44d-30</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 54-1. Parāmāsavippayuttaparāmaṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-44e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-44f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22985.7695528827\">6:23:05</span> 31. Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ parāmaṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto parāmaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44f-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22997.27834374251\">6:23:17</span> Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ aparāmaṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto aparāmaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23009.067126200272\">6:23:29</span> 32. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyalokuttaradukasadisaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.) ^7-44f-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23020.728618868394\">6:23:40</span> 33. Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ parāmaṭṭhaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto parāmaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-44f-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23038.14845496853\">6:23:58</span> 34. Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ parāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto parāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-44f-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23050.458993997137\">6:24:10</span> Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ aparāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto aparāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23064.15153977398\">6:24:24</span> Parāmāsavippayuttaṃ parāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca parāmāsavippayuttaṃ aparāmaṭṭhaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāsavippayutto parāmaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"23081.584872768257\">6:24:41</span> 35. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-44f-35</p><p><br /></p><p>Parāmāsagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":23099.067715}